ance. But whose feelings are we really talking about?\n https://t.co/8OKm4jgreu", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116124403109122078"}, {"author_id": "1327359720", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:42:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116103451235020957"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Rnb2Bk1klQ", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2116103451235020957/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116103223874347008", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/Rnb2Bk1klQ"}]}, "id": "2116103451235020957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 17340, "like_count": 227, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "\"Over the last two weeks we have seen episodes of sharp selloffs in tech stocks and the dollar at the same time. We have been arguing for a while that the risk-off properties of the dollar cannot be taken for granted in the event of an AI-driven correction in the market:\" DB's https://t.co/Rnb2Bk1klQ", "url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2116103451235020957"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:09:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116049840597881102"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/CrisisStudent/…", "end": 141, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/CrisisStudent/status/2115785218695012808", "start": 118, "url": "https://t.co/gKmEkOYhPj"}]}, "id": "2116049840597881102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7482, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115785218695012808", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Indeed.    Also applies to the balance of payments.   I suspect Philip Lane agrees.  Irish distortion in its analysis https://t.co/gKmEkOYhPj", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2116049840597881102"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:48:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116044513148100795"], "entities":